WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
Collaboration handles today's task;
shared context keeps the next one from starting over.

00:10.000 --> 00:24.000
Settled constraints guide design, code, and tests
without taking the Agent out of the task.

00:24.000 --> 00:29.000
Only a lasting ownership decision is proposed;
temporary implementation detail stays with the code.

00:29.000 --> 00:43.000
Independent review protects shared context
with source, consistency, and access checks.

00:43.000 --> 01:00.000
After approval, the durable decision becomes
the next Agent's starting point.
